Arrows	Move cursor
Home	Go to line start
End	Go to line end
Ctrl+Home	Go to document start
Ctrl+End	Go to document end
Ctrl+Up	Page up
Ctrl+Down	Page down
Ctrl+Left	Go to previous word
Ctrl+Right	Go to next word
Enter	Split line
Backspace	Delete left
Shift+BS	Delete right
Tab	Insert tab
Ctrl+Z	Undo line
F1	Insert/replace
F2	Open help
F3	Find text
F4	Mark selection
F5	Copy selection
F6	Move selection
F7	Find next match
F8	Delete selection
Shift+F1	Tab width 2/4/6/8
Shift+F2	Display KOI8-R / KOI7-R
Shift+F3	New document
Shift+F4	Load file
Shift+F5	Save file
Shift+F6	Append file
Shift+F9	Text / HEX view
F10 / STR	Exit editor
HEX 0-9, A-F	Replace a nibble immediately
HEX F5	Save file
HEX F6	KOI7-R / KOI8-R / All (with 6x8 font also CS)
HEX F7	Raw file / container header and body
HEX F8	Recalculate and write container checksums
HEX F9	Return to text
HEX F4	Mark byte range
HEX L/R	One nibble
HEX Shift+F1	Copy (raw)
HEX Shift+F2	Add zeros (raw)
HEX Shift+F3	Fill hex word
HEX Shift+F4	Overwrite block
RUS/LAT	Switch language
Shift+RUS	Caps Lock
